<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">id RUT - Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">CHITABU CHA RUTU</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Ruti</para>
  <para style="mt1">RUTI</para>
  <para style="imt">CHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli ino ya Rutu yandikighwa mna matsuwa ghala ghakuya mna chitabu cha walamutsi. Ruthu, pinga wa Moabu, tsakakwelighwa na Muisiraeli. Hayafile Ruthu, kamwonela batsu kulu chipfele wake, na tsakelapfa ghendo kumtambikila Imulungu, naye Imulungu kamwonela libatsi, kakwelighwa na mmale yungu iyolawila mna lukolo lwa mmale wake iyalongole. Apfo kubitila ukwelighwa kuno Ruthi kawa bibi yake Daudi, mndewa mkulu kubita wose mna Isiraeli yose.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Naomi na Ruti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Aho ghumwande mna matsuwa ghala Walamutsi hawang'ali woitawala Isiraeli, tsakulawila nzala ng'ulu. Munu yumwe iyolawila Betilehemu ya Yuda, kaghenda kukala chidogho mna isi ya Moabu, yeye na mwehe wake na iwanaghe weli. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Imunu ayo taghwa lyake Elimeleki na mwehe wake taghwa lyake Naomi, na wanaghe weli walume tsawakemighwa Maloni na Kilioni, wao wolawila mna likabila lya Waeflati ilili Betilehemu mna isi ya Yuda. Waghenda kukala mna isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Elimeleki mmale wake Naomi tsakafa, Naomi kalekighwa na iwanaghe weli. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Iwanaghe awo weli wakwela iwapinga wa kabila lya Moabu, yumwe tsakakemighwa Oripa na yungi tsakakemighwa Ruti, haimalile miyaka kumi, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Maloni na Kilioni tsawafa, Naomi lelo tsakayeka, tsakahela mmale wala iwanaghe weli.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi na Ruti wakuya Betilehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Matsuwa chidogho haghapfosile, Naomi kahulika ka Imulungu kawapfila iwanu wake kwa kuwaghalila ipfijo ako Moabu, Apfo Naomi na walipfala wake weli woka Moabu, woya ukaye yawo. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Naomi na walipfala wake walawa hanu hala hawang'ali wokala, wawinza inzila ighendile kune isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Naomi kawalongela walipfala wake, “Chila yumwe yoye ukaye kwa mai wake, na Imulungu yawatendele ghanoghile, ka mwemwe pfamnitendele nene ighanoghile na iwafile. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Na Imtwatsa Imulungu yamwapfileni mkwelighwe keli na muwe na tsing'anda tsenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Apfo Naomi kawaagha kwa kuwanonela. Lekeni wanza kulila kwa usungu. <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Wamlongela, “Bae tutsoghenda naghwe kwa iwanu wako.” <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Lekeni Naomi kawalongela, “Muye ukaye wanangu. Ebali mniwinza? Angu mwakona nitsakweleka iwana wangi iwatsowakwelani mwemwe? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Muye ukaye iwanangu, nene sambi nilala, sikwelighwa keli bae, na ning'alonga nololela ukweleka, hata ka leloli nechilo ning'awasa na mmale na kuwa na iwana, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />angu mtsowabeta mbaka wakule? Angu mtsokala bila kukwelighwa kwa kuwabeta wawo? Bae wanangu, nene nakona usungu kubita mwemwe kwaapfila Imulungu kaghaleka aghano ghandawile nene.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Baho walila keli. Kuya Oripa kamnonela mwalipfala wake, koya ukaye kwao, lekeni Ruti kamuwinza. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Naomi kamlongela, “Ulole miyagho kakuya kwa iwanu wake na kwa milungu yake, apfo naghwe uke naye.” <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Lekeni Ruti kamwidika, “Uleke kunilomba nikuleke ghweghwe, wala uleke kunighoma kukuwinza ghweghwe. Nene nitsoghenda Kwokwose kwaughenda, na nitsokala kwokwose kwautsokala. Iwanu wako watsakuwa iwanu wangu na Imulungu wako katsakuwa Imulungu wangu. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Haukufila na nene nitsakufila baho, na nitsotsikighwa baho. Imtwatsa Imulungu yandaghe ka nene notenda chinu chochose ichidaha kutubaghula nene na ghweghwe, ila ukufa kuliyeka kutsotubaghula nene na ghweghwe!” <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi hayonile Ruti kananahila kuka naye, ng'alongile naye bae. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Apfo wose weli waghendelela na ghumwanza ghwao mbaka wapfika Betilehemu. Hawapfikile ako, iwanu wose wakangawala, hata iwapinga walonga, “Angu ayu si Naomi bae?” <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naomi mana yake Deng'elela</char></note> kalonga, “Mleke kunikema keli Naomi, ila mnikeme Mara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mara mana yake usungu</char></note>, kwaapfila Imulungu yane ngupfu kanendela pfinu pfa usungu. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Nene nilawa hano na ipfinu pfingi, lekeni Imulungu kambuyitsa ghamoko ghaliyeka. Ule mwonikema Naomi aku Imulungu kanidununza, kanitenda nighaye?” <verse eid="RUT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Apfi pfipfo Naomi pfayoyile kulawa Moabu na Ruti Mmoabi, mwalipfala wake, wapfika Betilemu mna ghumsimu ghwa kupfuna shayili.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ruti Ketingana na Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Ako Yerusalemu tsakuna imunu iyakemighwa Boazi, iyolawila mna lukolo lwa Elimeleki, immale wake Naomi. Imunu yuno tsakamnyika sideke na tsakana mali nyingi. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Litsuwa limwe, Ruti ipinga yula iyalawile mna isi Moabu, kamlongela Naomi, “Leka nighende kumghunda nikasalalitse ipfijo ipfilekighwe. Songaa nitsomwona imunu iyatsondeka nisalalitse kuchughu kwake.” Naomi kamwidika, “Ona mwanangu, ghenda.” <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Apfo Ruti kaghenda kumghunda, kawawinza kuchughu iwanu iwopfuna aku kosalalitsa ipfijo ipfilekighwe, na baho katanga kumbe yang'ali yosang'ana mna mghunda ghwa Boazi, iyolawa mna lukolo lwa Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Ambele chidogho Boazi iyalawile Betilehemu tsakapfika, kawalamsa iwanu iwopfuna, kalonga, “Tseng'onde wayangu, Imulungu yakale namwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Nawo wamwidika, “Tsinogha, Naghwe Imulungu yakubaliki.” <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Kuya Boazi kamghutsa iyang'ali iyowemilila iwanu iwopfuna, “Angu imwali yula nani?” <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Naye kamwidika, “Imwali yula Mmoabu, katsa na Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Kanilomba nimleke yawawinze kuchughu iwanu iwopfuna kuya naye yasalalitse ipfijo ipfilekighwa, kasinda kosang'a kulawa nemitondo, lekeni sambi kaghenda kubwihila hane chibumbulika.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Kuya Boazi kamlongela Ruti, “Mwanangu tegheletsa, uleke kughenda kusalalitsa mna mghunda ghungi, wala uleke kuka hano, usang'ane na iwapinga wayagho. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Uwalole kwawopfuna kuya naghwe uwawinze kuchugho kwao. Niwakanya iwanu wangu waleke kukudesa, na ung'ona ing'ilu, ughende kune pfibuyu ukanwe ghamatsi ghawadeghile iwanu awo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Baho Ruti kamwinamila Boazi mbaka hasi, kamlongela, “Ule konendela uluso uno? Ebali umbonela libatsi nene yanili mgheni?” <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boazi kamwidika, “Wanongela ghose ghaumtendele mwalipfala wako kulawa hala hayafile mmale wako, na apfila pfaumlekile aba wako na mai wako, na isi yako na kutsa kukala na iwanu ng'ana uwamanye bae. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Imtwatsa Imulungu yakulihe kwa ghose ghautendile, Imulungu wa Isiraeli yaumtsumilile yakulolese, na yakwing'e ighanoghile.” <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Ruti kamwidika, “Mkulu wangu, kunitendela wende mkulu ghendo, hata ka nene si ka yumwe wa iwatumwa wako, ghweghwe kunikanza na kulonga na nene kwa unoghelo mkulu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Hawang'ali wakuja, Boazi kamlongela Ruti, “Soghela hano, usole chighate upfabike mna mtsuwo.” Apfo Ruti kakala na iwanu iwopfuna, kuya Boazi kamwing'a ingano itsingighwe, kaja keghuta mbaka kaleka. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Hayenuke yaghende kusalalitsa, Boazi kawalaghitsa iwanu wake, kalonga, “Mlekeni yasalalitse mbaka hane pfilundo, mleke kumghoma. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Pfipfila mumkwanyulile imikungwi kulawa mna pfilundo na mumleke yadondole wala mleke kumghoma.” <verse eid="RUT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Apfo Ruti kaghendelela kusalalitsa imikungwi mbaka nemihe, na hayahulule imikungwi ayo ya shayili na kubeta, kapata pishi mbili na makimbo meli. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Ketwika, koya ukaye, kamlangusa mwalipfala wake chayasalalitse, kuya Ruti kalapfa na kamwing'a ipfijo pfila pfayalekile kuja hala hayeghutile. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Mwalipfala wake kamghutsa, “Udondole kwani yose ino? Tsapfili mghunda ghwa nani? Imulungu yambaliki imunu yula iyakwonele libatsi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Kuya Ruti kamlongela mwalipfala wake ka tsakasalalitsa mna mghunda ghwa imunu iyokemighwa Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naye Naomi kamlongela mwalipfala wake, “Imtwatsa Imulungu yambaliki Boazi! Yeye ng'alekagha bae kututendela twetwe ighanoghile ituli waghima na wayetu iwafile.” Kuya kaghendelela kalonga, “Imunu ayo ndughu yetu ghendo, yeye ka yumwe mna wala wane isang'ano ya kutulela twetwe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Kuya Ruti Mmoabu kalonga, “Pfipfila kanongela, nikale na iwanu wake iwosang'ana mbaka hawomalitsa kupfuna.” <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi kamlongela Ruti mwalipfala wake, “Ona mwanangu. Pfinogha ghweghwe kusang'ana na iwapinga iwali mna mghunda ghwa Boazi, kwaapfila mna mghunda ghwa munu yungi iwanu wodaha kukudesa.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Apfo Ruti kasang'ana nawo, kasalalitsa mikungwi mbaka hawamalitse kupfuna ingano na shayili. Matsuwa agho ghose yang'ali yokala kwa mwalipfala wake.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ruti kopata Mmale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Kuya Naomi kamlongela Ruti mwalipfala wake, “Mwanangu, angu ambe pfinogha nene nikubamile mmale yakukwele, naye yakutunze? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Mmale mwenyegho Boazi, iyane iwapinga yausang'ane nawo, yeye imunu wa lukolo lwetu, Leloli nemihe koyobeta ishayili yake. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Apfo woghe, ubake ghamafuta, upfale pfinoghile, kuya ughende hanu hayobetela ingano yake, lekeni aleke kukumanya mbaka ahala hayomalitsa ukuja na ukunwa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Pfipfila uhamanye hanu hayowasa, na ang'awasa, mghendele lughalugha ufunule ligholole hane maghulu ghake, naghwe uwase baho, naye katsokulongela chokutenda.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Ruti kamwidika, “Ghose ghaulonga nitsoghatenda.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Apfo Ruti kaghenda hanu hala ho kubetela ishayili, katenda ka pfayamlongele mwalipfala wake. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boazi hayamalitse ukuja na ukunwa, tsakasangalala, kaghenda kuwasa hane lilundo lye ishayili. Ruti kaghenda lughalugha, kafunula ligholole hane maghulu gha Boazi kuya kawasa baho. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Mna chilo chikulu, Boazi kabwighinduka, kahunduka na baho tsakeduka hayamwonile ipinga kawasa hane maghulu ghake. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Kaghutsa, “Angu ghweghwe uli nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Ruti kamwidika, “Nene Ruti, imtumwa wako, ungubike gholelo lyako kulangusa ka kobamighwa kunitunza, ung'wele kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa imunu wa lukolo lwetu.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boazi kamwidika, “Imtwatsa Imulungu yakubaliki, kwaapfila uluso waututendele mkulu kubita ula waututendele ghumwande, mana ng'aubamile bae iwabwanga iwalihela chinu au awala iwane mali wakukwele. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Lelo uleke kupfuka Ruti, nitsokutendela ghose ghaubama kwaapfila iwanu wose iwali mna ghumji ghuno wokumanya ka ghweghwe kwa ipinga yunoghile. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ona ghendo, nene nobamighwa kukutunza ghweghwe, lekeni kuna ndughu yungi iyali habehi kubita nene yobamighwa kukutunza ghweghwe. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Apfo ukale hano chilo chose, na ilupfi nemitondo tutsolola ka katsotoghola au katsolema kukutunza, Ang'atoghola pfinogha, ang'alema, nene nelaha kwa taghwa lye Imulungu nitsokutunza. Uwase hano mbaka nemitondo.” <verse eid="RUT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Apfo Ruti kawasa hamaghulu hake mbaka nemitondo, lekeni tsakedawa mitondotondo koka ili iwanu waleke kumtanga, mana Boazi ng'abamile bae imunu yamanye ka Ruti tsakawasa hala. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boazi kamlongela, “Ugholose hasi ikanga yako iyawighubike.” Naye Ruti katenda pfipfo. Kuya Boazi kamwikila Shayili debe limwe, kamtwika. Kuya ipinga ayo koya ukaye yake. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Ruti hayapfikile ukaye, mwalipfala wake kamghutsa, “Lelo yuiletsa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Ruti kamlongela ghose ghayamtendele Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Kalonga keli, “Kanongela ndeke kuya ukaye kwa mwalipfala wangu ghamoko ghaliyeka, apfo kangaya shayili debe limwe.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naye Naomi kalonga, “Lelo mwanangu ubetetse, mbaka wone choni ichitsolawila, kwaapfila leloli Boazi ng'atsobwihila bae mbaka yaimalitse mbuli ino.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boazi komkwela Ruti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boazi tsakeghenda kune libani lya ghumji, hanu ha kwitinganganila iwanu kakala baho. Kuya indughu yula wa Elimeleki, Boazi iyalongile mbuli tsake tsakabita baho. Boazi kamkema, kalonga “Soghela hano sale yangu,” Naye kasoghela, kakala hasi. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Boazi kawakema wanzee kumi, kawalomba wakale hasi, nawo wakala hasi. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Baho Boazi kamlongela ndughu yake yula, “Lelo Naomi iyoyile kulawa mna isi ya Moabu, kobama yautse mghunda tsa ghwa ndughu yetu Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Lelo nene mbona ng'apfu tanu nikulongele ghweghwe, ka koghubama, ughukombole aku iwanu iwakalile hano wolola. Na ka ng'ughubama bae, unongele nimanye. Kwaapfila kuduhu imunu wa kughukombola ila ghweghwe, kuya nene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Naye kedika, “Nitsoghukombola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boazi kalonga, “Pfinogha, lekeni ung'aghukombola mghunda aghwo kulawa kwa Naomi, pfipfila umkwele Ruti, mwehe wa ndughu yetu iyafile, yawe mwehe wako ili mghunda aghwo ghuwe ghwa lukolo lwa ndughu yetu iyafile.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Imunu yula kedika, “Sitsoghukombola bae mghunda aghwo, nokuleka ghweghwe ughukombole. Nene sidaha bae, kwaapfila iwanangu ng'awatsolisi bae mghunda aghwo.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Mna matsuwa agho, imunu ang'abama kughombola chinu au kughombola mali kwa miyaghe, wang'ali wotsulagha likwabatsa limwe na kumwing'a imunu iyokombola chinu. Apfi pfipfo Waisiraeli pfawang'ali welaghana.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Imunu yula kamlongela Boazi, “Ghukombole ghweghwe.” Katsula likwabatsa lyake kamwing'a Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Kuya Boazi kawalongela iwanzee wala na iwanu wose iwakalile hala, “Leloli mwemwe mwa wakalangama wangu, mwona wenyegho ka nene nighombola ipfinu pfose ipfiwile pfa Elimeleki, Kilioni na Mahiloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Pfipfila, ayu Ruti Mmoabi, mwehe wake Mahiloni, nimkwela yawe mwehe wangu, ili tsimali tsikale mna lukolo lwa ndughu yetu iyafile, na taghwa lyake lileke kwagha mna ndughu tsake wala akaye yake, Mwemwe mwa wakalangama.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Iwanu wose iwakalile hala na iwanzee wala walonga, “Ona twetwe twose twawakalangama. Imtwatsa Imulungu yamtende ipinga yuno iyakwingila ukaye yako, yawe ka Raheli na Lea, iwamwelekele Yakobo iwana wengi, naghwe ubwede mna Efulata na uwe imunu iyomanyika mna Betilehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Iwana iyokwing'a Imtwatsa Imulungu kulawa kwa ipinga yuno wawe ka iwana wa Pelesi, iwana wa Yuda na Tamali.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boazi ne watsukulu wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Apfo Boazi kamkwela Ruti, kawa mwehe wake. Imtwatsa Imulungu kambaliki Ruti, naye kakinda inda, keleka imwana mmale. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Iwapinga wa ghumji aghwo wamlongela Naomi, “Umtunye Imulungu, yeye ng'akulekile bae leloli bila kuwa na imunu iyali habei wo kukutunza, taghwa lya imwana ayu limanyike mna isi yose ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Imwana ayu katsokutenda wibone kwa mwali na katsokutunza hautsolala, kwaapfila mwalipfala wako, iyokunoghela ng'ani, naye kanogha kubita iwanaghe saba, iyo iyamweleke.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Kuya Naomi kamsola imwana, kamlela.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Iwapinga iwakalile habehi naye walonga, “Naomi kana mwana,” taghwa lyake Obedi. Obedi kamweleka Yese, na Yese kamweleka Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Aluno lulo lukolo lwa Pelesi. Pelesi kamweleka Hesironi. <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hesironi kamweleka Ramu, Ramu kamweleka Aminadabu, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabu kamweleka Nashoni, Nashoni kamweleka Salimoni, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:7">Hos 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salimoni kamweleka Boazi, Boazi kamweleka Obedi, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi kamweleka Yese, na Yese kamweleka Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>